  Slug: shielded-fortune
  DisplayName: Shielded Fortune
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "You've always been tougher than your peers. As a child, you may have
    been able to endure the rough-and-tumble horseplay with friends more easily.
    You regularly emerged relatively unscathed from accidents could have been quite
    dangerous. At some point in your past, you had a particularly close call with
    death\u2014be it from a near-fatal accident, a fight gone horribly wrong, a close
    call with illness, or something similar, yet you quickly recovered. You may or
    may not believe you're more fated to face unexpected hardship in your life, but
    regardless, you know you can take what destiny has to dish out. This background
    is associated with the suit of Shields. Choose two attribute boosts. One must
    be to Constitution , and one is a free attribute boost. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Toughness]
    general feat and also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Fated Not
    to Die] free action."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Stolen Fate Player's Guide
